* Mutant: a poly resistor in series with the vinn gate adds a pole inside the feedback loop,
* so phase margin falls below 60 degrees while gain and bandwidth still pass
.subckt ota_5t vss ibias vdd vinn vinp vout
XM1 nleft vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XM2 vout vinn_g tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XM3 nleft nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XM4 vout nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XM5 tail ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=300 nf=30
XM6 ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=90 nf=9
XRG vinn vinn_g vss sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po w=1 l=1
.ends ota_5t
